OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow's Citizens Theatre wins
OL,4,Abest in Britain award
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow's Citizens Theatre has been
OL,7,Fnamed as Britain's top theatre in a new
OL,8,Fnationwide award.
OL,10,FThe inaugural Great British Theatre
OL,11,FAwards were hosted by the Theatres
OL,12,FTrust, an advisory body for the stage
OL,13,Findustry, to mark the organisation's
OL,14,F50th anniversary.
OL,16,F"The Citz" was named as the Great
OL,17,FBritish Theatre of 2026 and was also
OL,18,Fpraised for the "remarkable
OL,19,Ftransformation" that brought it back
OL,20,Finto use after seven years.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
