OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow's Citizens Theatre wins
OL,4,Abest in Britain award
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter originally closing in 2018 for a
OL,7,Fthree-year renovation, the theatre went
OL,8,Fthrough several years of uncertainty as
OL,9,Fcosts spiralled and work was delayed by
OL,10,Fthe Covid-19 pandemic.
